{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10291020","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10291020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1029102001:1":{"text":"당신의 독실한 신자가 되어 하수인을 관리하겠습니다...","source_cn":"我愿成为您最忠实的眷属，管理您的仆从——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30FEAEF96F8DB19B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029102002:1":{"text":"꼬마 친구, 여기는 위험한 곳이니 멀리 떨어지세요.","source_cn":"这位小朋友，这里很危险，请远离此处。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB97A62F8B219DBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029102003:1":{"text":"하, 나는 심연 악마의 가족 된 자이다. 그리고 넌, 빛의 잔당이지.","source_cn":"呵。吾乃深渊恶魔之眷属，而汝，乃光明之党羽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBE1C1960B38E9B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029102004:1":{"text":"난 네놈의 진짜 목적을 알고 있다. 내가 주인을 배반하게끔 꾀려는 것이야. 네 뜻대로 되진 않을 것이다!","source_cn":"吾早已知悉到汝的真实目的，无非是欲引导吾背叛吾主。汝等...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA11A1918B731B671","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029102005:1":{"text":"저 여자아이가 뭐라고 하는 거죠? 제가 너무 멍청한 건가요? 한 마디도 못 알아듣겠어요...","source_cn":"这个女孩在说什么？是我太笨了吗，怎么感觉完全听不懂……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x437F9188AFB50894","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029102006:1":{"text":"이번엔 치피 문제는 아닌 것 같아. 나도 못 알아들었거든...","source_cn":"这次，应该不是满满的问题。因为我也听不太懂……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92E493743774227E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1029102006":{"text":"이번엔 치피 문제는 아닌 것 같아. 나도 못 알아들었거든...","source_cn":"这次，应该不是满满的问题。因为我也听不太懂……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92E493743774227E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029102007:1":{"text":"역시 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님! 이렇게 어려운 내용도 알아들으시다니!","source_cn":"真不愧是<style=stress><player_n...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x63BE303A4BC0E9C1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"역시 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님! 이렇게 어려운 내용도 알아들으시다니!","female":"역시 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님! 이렇게 어려운 내용도 알아들으시다니!","variant_male_record_index":"115588","variant_female_record_index":"115589","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029102009:1":{"text":"균열 사이로 몬스터가 빠져나오고 있... 어어, 우리 쪽으로 오고 있어요!","source_cn":"快看那边，裂隙里好像逸出了魔物……往我们这边扑过来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC80093FD752808B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1029102010:1":{"text":"이것은... 셀리오스 님의 하수인! 셀리오스 님, 역시 저의 기도를 들으셨군요… 음?","source_cn":"这是……赛利欧斯大人的仆从！赛利欧斯大人，您果然听到了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8217086A027A1342","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1029102011:1":{"text":"마스터! 저 몬스터가 여자아이 쪽을 향해 가는 것 같아요!","source_cn":"主人！那个魔物好像往女孩的方向去了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFC017CAFDD9B45F4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터! 저 몬스터가 여자아이 쪽을 향해 가는 것 같아요!","female":"마스터! 저 몬스터가 여자아이 쪽을 향해 가는 것 같아요!","variant_male_record_index":"115594","variant_female_record_index":"115595","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"나는 알아들었는걸","source_cn":"我倒是能听懂","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1C38BBAB5EB9F8D8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"나는 알아들었는걸","female":"나는 알아들었는걸","variant_male_record_index":"62342","variant_female_record_index":"62343","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1029102008:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님도 못 알아들으신 걸 보니 저 여자아이에게 문제가 있는 게 분명해요!","source_cn":"竟然连<style=stress><player_na...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x53F63D58FDF8510A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님도 못 알아들으신 걸 보니 저 여자아이에게 문제가 있는 게 분명해요!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님도 못 알아들으신 걸 보니 저 여자아이에게 문제가 있는 게 분명해요!","variant_male_record_index":"115590","variant_female_record_index":"115591","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:1:2":{"text":"나도 못 알아들었는걸","source_cn":"我也听不懂","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3D48753A28